# S34-T07: a process started by a signal, read from the process log. Replace the object, the process and the captions with those of your site.
# writes
use Supervisor
insert UsrOrder as B set UsrName=Bed;UsrAmount=10
update UsrOrder $B set UsrAmount=500
check-process UsrOrder_Process for $B started within 30 second
check-process UsrOrder_Process for $B step "Mark big" completed within 30 second
delete UsrOrder $B
